---
title: All writing
teaser: "Everything in one place — blog posts, digesting bookmarks, and impact stories."
layout: layouts/base.njk
pagination:
  data: collections.allContent
  size: 15
  alias: pagedPosts
permalink: "/all/{% if pagination.pageNumber > 0 %}{{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}/{% endif %}"
---
{%- set siteConfig = siteConfig.siteInformation -%}
{%- set isFirstPage = pagination.pageNumber == 0 -%}
{%- set glance = collections.allContent | corpusStats -%}
<section>
  <h1 class="kh-font-headline kh-font-headline--display kh-text-heading--1">{{title}}</h1>

  {%- if isFirstPage %}
  {#- What this page is, before the undifferentiated list of everything.
      The three sections below are genuinely different kinds of writing and
      a reader has no way to know that from titles alone. -#}
  <div class="kh-content">
    <p>Every entry on the site in one register, newest first. Three kinds of
    thing sit here together: <strong>blog posts</strong>, which are written
    pieces; <strong>digesting</strong> entries, which are something I read
    plus what I took from it; and <strong>impact stories</strong>, which are
    write-ups of work I actually shipped. They are mixed here on purpose
    &mdash; if you would rather keep them apart, the three links below do
    that.</p>
    <p>New here? <a href="/blog/#start-here">Start with the picked posts</a>
    rather than the top of this list; newest is not the same as best.</p>
  </div>
  {%- endif %}

  {#- The three sections of the register. Nav collapsed to a single
      "Writing" entry, so this page is where they are reached from.

      First page only, like the intro and the pace figures above. On /all/4/ a
      reader is deep in a chronological list and has already chosen not to
      branch off; repeating the whole panel there pushes the actual list below
      the fold and restates counts for the entire corpus next to a slice of
      fifteen entries. The footer carries the same four links on every page. -#}
  {%- if isFirstPage %}
  <div class="kh-section-head kh-u-margin__top--1200">
    <h2 id="sections" class="kh-text-heading--2"><span class="kh-section-number">1.0</span>Sections</h2>
    <span class="kh-meta">{{ collections.allContent | length }} entries in total</span>
  </div>
  <div class="kh-panel">
    <div class="kh-panel__row" style="--kh-panel-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr">
      <div class="kh-panel__cell">
        <span class="kh-panel__label">Blog</span>
        <a href="/blog/">Longer pieces &amp; notes</a>
        <span class="kh-meta kh-u-margin__top--200">{{ collections.blogPosts | length }} entries</span>
      </div>
      <div class="kh-panel__cell">
        <span class="kh-panel__label">Digesting</span>
        <a href="/digesting/">Bookmarks &amp; reading</a>
        <span class="kh-meta kh-u-margin__top--200">{{ collections.digesting | published | length }} entries</span>
      </div>
      <div class="kh-panel__cell">
        <span class="kh-panel__label">Work</span>
        <a href="/work/">Impact stories</a>
        <span class="kh-meta kh-u-margin__top--200">{{ collections.impactStories | length }} entries</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="kh-panel__row" style="--kh-panel-columns: 1fr">
      <div class="kh-panel__cell">
        <span class="kh-panel__label">By subject</span>
        <a href="/directory/#subjects">Browse by topic</a>
        <span class="kh-meta kh-u-margin__top--200">{{ collections.topics | length }} topics</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  {%- endif %}

  {%- if isFirstPage %}
  <div class="kh-section-head kh-u-margin__top--1200">
    <h2 id="pace" class="kh-text-heading--2"><span class="kh-section-number">2.0</span>Pace &amp; scale</h2>
    <span class="kh-meta">Counted at build time &middot; <a href="/stats/">more</a></span>
  </div>
  {%- set glanceLabel = "entries" %}
  {% include "partials/register-glance.njk" %}
  {%- endif %}

  <div class="kh-section-head kh-u-margin__top--1200">
    {#- Sole section on a pager page, so it numbers from the top there. -#}
    <h2 id="everything" class="kh-text-heading--2"><span class="kh-section-number">{% if isFirstPage %}3.0{% else %}1.0{% endif %}</span>Everything</h2>
    <span class="kh-meta">Newest first{% if not isFirstPage %} &middot; page {{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}{% endif %}</span>
  </div>
  {% include "partials/search-box.njk" %}

  {#- The entry list is other entries' titles and teasers, so it is chrome by
      the CLAUDE.md rule -- the same marker topic pages and the archive already
      carry. Without it a search for "drupal" returned "All writing" (pages
      /all/4/ and /all/5/) as results, competing with the articles themselves.
      The page's own intro stays indexed, so it is still findable as a page. -#}
  <div class="kh-datasheet-list" data-pagefind-ignore>
  {%- for post in pagedPosts -%}
    {% include "partials/post-summary.njk" %}
  {%- endfor -%}
  </div>

  {% include "partials/pager.njk" %}
</section>
